  <item>
    <title>EP2：每次读书都犯困？这些内容形式也能让你高效成长</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67021e3b6c7f81778606642b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67021e3b6c7f81778606642b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Oct 2024 05:20:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>整理了一下这些年来自己获取知识的一些方法和习惯，的确我也读了一些书，甚至有些书还写了读后感。但我也发现，从书本获取信息确实在我所有的渠道里面，占得比重不大，特别在大厂很卷的日子里，要读完一本书，对我来说，或者 maybe 对很多人来说，是非常有难度的。所以，这期节目，我想分享和梳理一下自己除了读书以外，其他一些获取输入的方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 浅聊一下读书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 长视频更有深度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 访谈与播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 发现故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2565">42:45</a> 灵感知识库</span></p><span></span><p><span>Free Solo -- Alex Honnold</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FonpxbaGZ4i6GX_NirSVsWGq9dQn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>A Divorce Attorney's Thoughts On Love and Marriage -- James Sexton</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuSwa1I6qEG6hgCRtzcQl0L6ONRw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Black Hat Hacker -- Gummo</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FovDD14b-K7n5G5dOG3utvPbg-Pl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Ex Gang Member interview -- Johnny</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkqsMimm_U5Yob2EjRhpLQj_6DFx.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>综合信息来源</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>长视频/(海外播客/访谈)：YouTube/Bilibili</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>海外播客平台：Spotify/YouTube/Apple Podcast</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期内容提到的 Podcasts</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Soft White Underbelly</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Lex Fridman</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Andrew Huberman</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Joe Rogan</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>信息消费辅助工具</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>了解工具：Speachify, Trancy</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>网页笔记工具：note anywhere</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>知识库</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Notion</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Obsidian</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>本期稿件：</span><a href="https://artsylab.notion.site/EP2-10f87fa10f7b8033bd3af018ecbb91d5?pvs=4" data-url="https://artsylab.notion.site/EP2-10f87fa10f7b8033bd3af018ecbb91d5?pvs=4"><span>EP2：每次读书都犯困？这些内容形式也能让你高效成长</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：Street Lights - Kanye West/Ye</span></p>]]></description>
